    "text": "Exercise 3.2, Question 3(iii): Form a pair of linear equations for this problem and find the solution by substitution: A coach buys 7 bats and 6 balls for ₹3800. Later, she buys 3 bats and 5 balls for ₹1750. Find the cost of each bat and each ball.",
