    "text": "Exercise 3.2, Question 3(v): Form a pair of linear equations for this problem and find the solution by substitution: A fraction becomes 9/11 if 2 is added to its numerator and denominator. If 3 is added to its numerator and denominator, it becomes 5/6. Find the fraction.",
